  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:</i>&nbsp;<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>The chosen Weapon of the Imperial Stormtrooper Corps, the ARC-9965 Blaster Rifle from BlasTech is a significant upgrade over the E-11 Blaster Rifles used by <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stormtroopers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stormtroopers\">Stormtroopers</a> during the Galactic Civil War. It is designed with accuracy in mind, with input from some of the galaxy's best sharpshooters. </p><p>The ARC-9965 is not without its flaws. The higher-accuracy blaster bolts consume more energy than a standard <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Blaster_Rifle\" title=\"Blaster Rifle\">Blaster Rifle</a>, lowering its ammunition capacity. Additionally, since the weapon is designed more for accuracy than for sprays of fire, each <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Autofire\" title=\"Autofire\">Autofire</a> attack made with the Weapon consumes 10 shots. </p><p>An ARC-9965 Blaster requires a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a>&nbsp;to operate. After 40 shots, the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a>&nbsp;must be replaced. The ARC-9965 Blaster also has a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Retractable_Stock\" title=\"Retractable Stock\">Retractable Stock</a>. </p><p><b>Accurate:</b> This weapon takes no penalty when firing at targets at Short&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p>",
